{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7e56e63d1d40dcda5f0e55b683b45d2b73e440eb90fe08ddce7d84fc274d1215", "ja": "（リバイバル公演が一段落し、忙しさも落ち着いて\nきた。今日は久しぶりにのんびりできそうだな）", "zh": "（复演公演告一段落，忙碌也渐渐平息下来。今天好像终于能久违地悠闲一下了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "f8de793bce7650267201ab5068a82b77bf36cf02f4aec7a45fe09c1bc5397991", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nちょうどよかったのです。はいほー！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n来得正好。嗨哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8d6a0fc93b06b2454ea3daaa9e1cdbcb4e135bafb3fb620fb6d979a021715c17", "ja": "お、まつりじゃないか。どうかしたのか？", "zh": "哦，这不是小祭吗。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "fe35692dccd4c8c4ffede164c73f53b44bd23e3c0317f8e8891882adc9a503e1", "ja": "実は今日、素敵な香水を持って来たのです。\nせっかくなので、匂いを嗅いでみてほしいのです。", "zh": "其实今天，茉莉带了很棒的香水过来哦。\n难得带来了，想让你闻闻看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "4c89ddb64bb3f9027a5d27c1aaa6c947441065e8fc55cd83b2e9d0bafb704231", "ja": "瓶ごと持って来たので、遠慮せずに……。\nさあ、一気にぐいっと！　どうぞ、なのです。", "zh": "因为是连瓶一起带来的，所以不用客气……  \n来，一口气咕嘟咕嘟地喝下去吧！请用，哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_1005_p", "source_sha256": "307c341197f9127d6a6a6d9ded3073709418a237f98e6b3aefd81d7a69819c9a", "ja": "いや、それだと飲むみたいだけど……。\nどれどれ……？", "zh": "不，这样听起来像是要喝掉……。\n我看看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_1006", "source_sha256": "cfc1de390893ab4c5f99cfdd4175002945f72c48702618b0aab4befb8f516b33", "ja": "くんくん", "zh": "嗅嗅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d24cdd00dd5375a022157efc2eabdee7913b20650184eeb25f13e36c2c27aeae", "ja": "……うーん？　いい匂いだとは思うけど。\nこれって、何の匂いなんだ？", "zh": "……嗯？虽然觉得挺香的。\n不过这究竟是什么香味啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2001_021mat", "source_sha256": "3b278f256cbca010b57a293a793252de91cdfa37bf090c5960da60031dd89c71", "ja": "ふふっ。これは、すずらんの香水なのです！\n姫、見つけた瞬間に、思わず買ってしまったのです。", "zh": "呵呵，这是铃兰香水哦！\n本公主一看到，就忍不住买下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2002_021mat", "source_sha256": "92fa2a61cd1472360c09eb29a14c3ab0f2838a0cacfc0866ab2ad1ab9e13dd42", "ja": "この前、エミリーちゃんと出演した番組で\n嗅いだ香水の匂いと、同じ匂いなのです。", "zh": "和艾米莉一起参加的那个节目里闻到的香水味，和这个是一样的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2003_p", "source_sha256": "4c36e93f1885cb6d6932ee86ce569c1d5bb911028ccf6491a28662f607dde5c6", "ja": "ああ、そういえば……。\nなるほど、こういう匂いだったんだな。", "zh": "啊，这么说来……原来如此，是这样的气味啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2004_021mat", "source_sha256": "9f5c7899aed197acb9623111cce05824f5d6a37c8845ceaee0e6d4f212aa9751", "ja": "はいなのです。フレッシュで、ちょっと独特な\n香りですけど、姫には似合うと思うのです！", "zh": "是的哦。虽然清新中带着些许独特的香味，但我觉得很适合本公主！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2005_021mat", "source_sha256": "2395ef2c5780276c387983df032a364899b6ec38d8225d8406c99b92512acdd4", "ja": "不思議な香りが、きっと姫の\n魔法のオーラを強くしてくれるのです。……ね？", "zh": "不可思议的香气，一定能让本公主的魔法气场变得更强。……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2006_p", "source_sha256": "38076968afd3749b0a3f8df593d54af52bc35f96e750890b917fe0840424950d", "ja": "そうだな。シャルロットっぽい香り、\nって言われたら、そんなような気がする。", "zh": "是啊。要是说这是很有夏洛特风格的香味，感觉还真有点像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2007_021mat", "source_sha256": "a72e9eb5be7910bc747ca42f8d699bc9f0b60504570f36f90f593b956dd51c56", "ja": "ふふふ、そして……姫はぬかりないのです。\nエミリーちゃんの分も、用意してあるのですよ。", "zh": "呵呵呵，而且……公主可是万无一失的哦。\n连艾米莉的那份也准备好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2008_021mat", "source_sha256": "6471c2c8b8bc136b32223152e5877537a171494e0937cc9728cd25c9d84cd881", "ja": "エミリーちゃんも、きっと欲しいと思ったので。\n追加で買っておいたのです。", "zh": "因为我觉得艾米莉也一定会想要，所以就另外买了一份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2009_p", "source_sha256": "ded7ec89cdac46204f44f8671c9f71a10f9d068e062e2e57545d6df541399b9f", "ja": "おっ、さすがだな！\nまつりと同じ香水……エミリー、きっと喜ぶぞ！", "zh": "哦，真不愧是你！\n和茉莉一样的香水……艾米莉肯定会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0303_2010_021mat", "source_sha256": "a22a4f47d81fe6fdbdbded6b60c5668530ed5d852d68d9c3401fa357ac383a9c", "ja": "はいほー！　ではさっそく、エミリーちゃんの\nところへ、れっつごー！なのですよ♪", "zh": "嗨呵——！那我们马上出发去艾米莉那里吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
